    <h2 class="article-title">Of Creation and Life</h2>
    <div class="article-body">
        <p><strong>We believe</strong> <span data-span="s1" data-article="A03" data-type="concept" data-named="false">God created this world</span> as a place where <span data-span="s2" data-article="A03" data-type="paraphrase" data-named="false">His spirit children live within bodies of mortal flesh</span>, <span data-span="s3" data-article="A03" data-type="paraphrase" data-named="false">walk with divinely-endowed agency</span>, <span data-span="s4" data-article="A03" data-type="paraphrase" data-named="false">encounter opposition of good and evil</span>, and <span data-span="s5" data-article="A03" data-type="concept" data-named="false">grow from within the experience</span>. <span data-span="s6" data-article="A03" data-type="concept" data-named="false">More than these general statements of faith we will not dogmatize within an interfaith fellowship</span>. We also believe that <span data-span="s7" data-article="A03" data-type="concept" data-named="false">this life is not an accident. It is not a punishment</span>. <span data-span="s8" data-article="A03" data-type="concept" data-named="false">The fall of humankind from paradise — the thorns, thistles, and sweat of mortality — were not beyond God's plans</span>. <span data-span="s12" data-article="A03" data-type="concept" data-named="false">We now live in a sphere of existence God designed for our benefit</span>, where <span data-span="s9" data-article="A03" data-type="concept" data-named="false">every soul has room to choose, to fall, to rise, and to be made new through His grace</span>. <span data-span="s11" data-article="A03" data-type="concept" data-named="false">The pains and pleasures of this existence are not evidence that God has abandoned us</span>. <span data-span="s10" data-article="A03" data-type="concept" data-named="false">Mortal experiences provide the developmental conditions under which our character is being shaped</span>. <span data-span="s13" data-article="A03" data-type="concept" data-named="false">We are free to either deny the Creator or to see the blessings inherent in this existence</span>. Either way, <span data-span="s14" data-article="A03" data-type="concept" data-named="false">these conditions remain, and the shaping takes place</span>.</p>
        <div class="article-rjw">
            <p class="rjw-prompt">What is something difficult in your life that, if it truly came from a loving God's hand, you might receive differently?</p>
